Fixed: FAC cycles with presmoothing or repeated coarse visits now maintain
separate composite correction equations over the full range of levels.
F_CYCLE uses a recursive F visit followed by a V visit, and FMG_CYCLE uses
nested initialization followed by a V correction at each finer level.
Added MU_CYCLE with a positive cycle_multiplicity parameter (default two).
The V-cycle without presmoothing retains its existing implementation.
